    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "AVAILABLE FOR SHORT TERM LET ONLY .\r\nPlease Read the ad before applying for the property SHORT TERM LEASE  ONLY . \r\nDate available 20 November  - 1May only SHORT TERM LET. \r\nLetting Solutions are proud to present to the rental Market  this beautiful  extended property.\r\nComprises 3 bed 3 bath. \r\n\r\nThis properrty is a beautiful family home with a very cosy setting offering a stunning marble fireplace with real open fire .The  cream country style kitchen is very modern with Amercian Fridge Freezer. Large Gas Range Cooker and  beautiful grainet worktops .  Floor to ceiling Glazed doors lead \r\n to the stunning courtyard and garden.  The property is Ideally located just off the Howth Road with Killester Dart station being a few minutes walk away, and plenty of buses to the city centre which is just 3 KM away .Local shops include a large Supervalu ,and Clontarf village is a mere 10 minute walk away which offers very fine restaurant bars and local shops.\r\nThe coast and beach is also just a short stroll away as is the famious Saint Annes Park ..\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThough the photos do this property some justice it must be seen to be appreicated .\r\n\r\nPlease email Patricia in Letting Solutions,  with your expression of interest.\r\nThis property would be ideally suited to local people taking on a renovations or building work. Also people who are in-between buying and selling \r\n\r\n\r\nPSRA 003292\r\nPatricia Letting Solutions"
      },
      {
